(global_label "AMP_SD" (shape bidirectional) (at 482.6 307.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "a7e4b2e9-8f70-5765-86f4-875211143540") (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 482.6 307.34 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) hide)))
(text "ES8311 Rev 5.0 recommended supply: DVDD/PVDD 1.6-3.6 V, AVDD 1.7-3.6 V, absolute max 3.6 V; hold +3V3_SYS inside 3.0-3.6 V or the codec keeps no headroom." (at 25.4 358.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "5a7a1157-06df-548e-8029-5a5717ba85a5"))
(text "ES8311 Rev 5.0 documents no mic bias or electret supply pin; the MIC1N reference and the mic bias network stay TBD with the microphone selection." (at 25.4 363.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "18d4d067-22f5-5b35-ad6a-44bd3e5049c7"))
(text "Codec I2C address is 0011 00x, CE strapped low gives 0x18; no clash with BMI270 0x68, RV-3028-C7 0x51/0x52, MAX17048 0x36 or DRV2605L 0x5A." (at 25.4 368.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "6a5e9dfd-b7fd-592a-885e-a9eb65b5bcd5"))
(text "ES8311 in slave mode expects externally supplied SCLK/LRCK; in master mode both derive from MCLK. Clock direction and ESP32 I2S feasibility remain unvalidated." (at 25.4 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "553b4329-1f7e-5de0-b5d4-8ee5b583073d"))
(text "PAM8302A delivers 0.72 W min / 0.80 W typ into 8 ohm at VDD=3.6 V and 10% THD+N; 1 W from a 3.3 V rail is not achievable. A 1 W speaker rating is not delivered power." (at 25.4 378.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "00508518-ab80-53e7-9e5c-b3e00a692f9a"))
(text "Amp VDD drafted on VBAT (2.0-5.5 V allowed, SHDN must stay within VDD+0.3 V); +3V3_SYS and SYS stay open options - confirm cell impedance and peak current with the pack data." (at 25.4 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "363b08e2-cbfc-546d-9fe2-4855a7bb875b"))
(text "SHDN releases through R601/C614 for a datasheet 1-100 ms delay after VBAT rises; no spare GPIO exists for explicit enable control." (at 25.4 388.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "4f914f72-1aed-586f-a28a-7bc4aa7b4d2b"))
(text "One 220 nF cap per side merges the ES8311 output coupling with the PAM8302A CI 0.1-0.22 uF requirement; corner against the internal 10 k is about 72 Hz." (at 25.4 393.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "5d1d45a4-7a6a-5e46-b836-a6ad1028e827"))
(text "Filterless BTL: never reference SPK_P or SPK_N to ground, keep the pair short, and add the datasheet ferrite-bead filter when the runs exceed 20 cm." (at 25.4 398.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "b565e820-18bd-5928-9ee4-1db982bb15f7"))
(text "ES8311 typical circuit separates GND(SYS) from AGND with 0 ohm; one GND net is kept until the PCB ground-strategy decision is taken." (at 25.4 403.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "2fc53d9a-c317-5bd0-bc48-d633e831c7a8"))
(text "Footprints, the ES8311 QFN-20 land pattern and the acoustic assembly are still not released." (at 25.4 408.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "e18d4355-d83b-5ac3-ae9c-26c22cd86b35"))
(text "ES8311 Rev 5.0 package drawing shows an unnumbered exposed die-attach pad and the typical circuit labels that pad 21/PGND, while the pin table lists only 1-20; U9 keeps 20 pins until the vendor release confirms the pad and its net." (at 254.0 358.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "3381e5bc-2b07-5693-9e5a-368d2431235c"))
(text "PAM8302A gain is fixed by the internal 150k/10k pair at 23.5 dB. The ES8311 full-scale output is 0.4535 Vrms, so the amp clips before full codec volume; trim with the DAC volume register or add an external RIN of about 16k ohm once the acoustic target is set." (at 254.0 363.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "11f96a2b-6c84-5802-aa88-9f119527be0c"))
)
